@startuml autonomous-product-execution-boundary
title Autonomous Product Execution Boundary ; per ADR-ES-017 §4 + CR-ES-017 §5

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

start
:Product Objective;
:Product Context;
:Sense / Assess;
:Decision;
:Action Selection;
:Product Execution;
:Observe Outcome;
if (Adapt?) then (yes)
  :Adapt;
elseif (Escalate?) then (yes)
  :Escalate;
endif

stop

note right
  Per ADR-ES-017 §4 + §6, the entire product does NOT need
  to operate autonomously. Mixed realization permitted.
  Bounded by 6 fences.
end note

@enduml
